AB  - The indications and utility of flexible bronchoscopy have expanded over the past 
      few decades with major innovations in design and development of new tools for 
      endobronchial interventions and image-guided tissue sampling techniques. This 
      review highlights the application of advanced diagnostic bronchoscopy (including 
      endobronchial ultrasound and CT navigational techniques), cryotherapy and the use 
      of one-way endobronchial valves for persistent air leak in the pediatric setting.
