      hyperinflation in severe COPD by implantation of endobronchial devices, such as 
      biodegradable material, endobronchial valves or bronchopulmonary stents, via 
      flexible bronchoscopy. This article discusses newest developments and results in 
      bronchoscopic lung volume reduction.
